      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "PGFX-ENHANCED STOCK LTXV PIPELINE\n===========================================\nThis workflow shows how PGFX nodes enhance a standard ComfyUI LTXV pipeline.\n\n- STOCK nodes (gray): Standard ComfyUI: model loading, VAE, scheduler, guider\n- PGFX nodes (colored): Replace/enhance stock parts:   - VisualThink + VisualInstruct: AI-powered prompt engineering (replaces manual prompts)\n   - PGFX_LTXVInContextSampler: IC-LoRA guided video sampling (replaces LTXVBaseSampler)\n   - PGFX_LTXVCorrectiveMask + PGFX_LTXVLatentUpsampler: Post-processing enhancements"
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "PGFX Enhancement Demo Overview"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        50,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        300,
        100
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "STEP 1: LOAD MODELS (STOCK)\nAll stock ComfyUI nodes.\nLoad your LTXV model, VAE,\nand CLIP text encoder."
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "1. Stock: Model Loading"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        650,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        350,
        140
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "STEP 2: AI-POWERED PROMPTING (PGFX -> STOCK)\nREPLACES: Manual CLIPTextEncode\n\nVisualThink generates a cinematic scene description.\nVisualInstruct converts it to structured JSON with\ncontent/style/camera/lighting/mood/palette/era/action keys.\nThe JSON feeds into CLIPTextEncode -> LTXVConditioning."
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "2. PGFX: Enhanced Prompting"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        1350,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        350,
        140
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "STEP 3: PGFX ENHANCED SAMPLING\nREPLACES: LTXVBaseSampler\n\nPGFX_LTXVInContextSampler supports:\n- IC-LoRA guided video generation (guiding_latents)\n- Multi-stage denoising (start/end step control)\n- Optional keyframe image conditioning\n- AV model support (LTXAV NestedTensor)"
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "3. PGFX: Enhanced Sampler"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        1850,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        300,
        140
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "STEP 4: PGFX POST-PROCESSING (OPTIONAL)\nEnhancements on top of stock nodes:\n\nPGFX_LTXVCorrectiveMask:\nFix noise mask for inpainted latents.\n\nPGFX_LTXVLatentUpsampler:\nUpscale latents before VAE decode."
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "4. PGFX: Post-Processing"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        2450,
        200
      ],
      "size": [
        250,
        100
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "STEP 5: DECODE & OUTPUT (STOCK)\nStandard VAEDecode and\nVHS_VideoCombine."
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "5. Stock: Output"
      }
    },
