      "widgets_values": [
        "WHAT PGFX REPLACES IN THE STOCK PIPELINE\n==========================================\n\nSTOCK                          -> PGFX ENHANCED\n---------------------------------------------------\nCLIPTextEncode (manual prompt) -> VisualThink + VisualInstruct (AI-generated JSON)\nLTXVBaseSampler                -> PGFX_LTXVInContextSampler (IC-LoRA, multi-stage)\n(no mask fix)                  -> PGFX_LTXVCorrectiveMask (noise mask repair)\n(no upscale)                   -> PGFX_LTXVLatentUpsampler (latent upscaling)\n\nAll other nodes are standard ComfyUI stock nodes."
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Stock vs PGFX Comparison"
      }
